sequenceDiagram
    participant EC2 as EC2 Instance (VPC)
    participant Resolver as .2 Resolver<br/>(VPC built-in DNS)
    participant PHZ as Private Hosted Zone<br/>internal.company.com
    participant Out as Outbound<br/>Resolver Endpoint
    participant Corp as Corporate DNS<br/>(On-Premises) corp.local
    participant In as Inbound<br/>Resolver Endpoint

    EC2->>Resolver: DNS query
    alt internal.company.com
        Resolver->>PHZ: query resolve
        PHZ-->>Resolver: IP রিটার্ন
    else corp.local (on-prem domain)
        Resolver->>Out: forward rule অনুযায়ী পাঠানো
        Out->>Corp: query forward (VPN/DX দিয়ে)
        Corp-->>Out: IP রিটার্ন
    end
    Resolver-->>EC2: DNS উত্তর

    Note over Corp,In: উল্টো দিকে — On-prem থেকে AWS-এর domain resolve
    Corp->>In: aws-internal query forward
    In->>Resolver: query পাঠানো
    Resolver-->>In: IP রিটার্ন
    In-->>Corp: DNS উত্তর
